<ui title="展区三 · 真正的本地交互" fallback="切换近 7 天与近 30 天，指标与趋势图随本地状态即时更新。">

  <paragraph>
    这里没有任何脚本。<code>state</code> 声明一份可替换的本地值，<code>segmented</code> 通过
    <code>bind="$state.range"</code> 与它双向绑定：<emphasis>点下去只是替换一个对象，不会产生新的模型请求</emphasis>。
  </paragraph>

  <state name="range" value='{"current":{"value":"12,480","delta":"+18.2%","caption":"近 7 天累计"},"series":[{"label":"周四","value":1420},{"label":"周五","value":1680},{"label":"周六","value":1310},{"label":"周日","value":1190},{"label":"周一","value":1830},{"label":"周二","value":2240},{"label":"周三","value":2810}]}' />

  <segmented bind="$state.range" label="统计范围" options='[{"label":"近 7 天","value":{"current":{"value":"12,480","delta":"+18.2%","caption":"近 7 天累计"},"series":[{"label":"周四","value":1420},{"label":"周五","value":1680},{"label":"周六","value":1310},{"label":"周日","value":1190},{"label":"周一","value":1830},{"label":"周二","value":2240},{"label":"周三","value":2810}]}},{"label":"近 30 天","value":{"current":{"value":"48,296","delta":"+12.4%","caption":"近 30 天累计"},"series":[{"label":"第 1 周","value":9320},{"label":"第 2 周","value":11040},{"label":"第 3 周","value":12680},{"label":"第 4 周","value":15256}]}}]' />

  <divider />

  <row gap="md" align="stretch">
    <metric label="交互渲染总量" value="$state.range.current.value" delta="$state.range.current.delta" caption="$state.range.current.caption" />
    <metric label="日均渲染" value="1,783" caption="按当前区间折算" />
    <metric label="本地交互占比" value="93.7%" caption="未产生模型往返" variant="info" />
  </row>

  <card title="渲染量走势" subtitle="随所选区间切换">
    <chart type="line" series="$state.range.series" />
  </card>

  <callout variant="info" title="为什么它不是一次远程请求">
    <paragraph>
      状态对象是纯数据，替换它只会让绑定该路径的节点重新求值。切换区间不新建消息、不追加 token、不等待网络，
      也不需要宿主做任何额外的往返。
    </paragraph>
  </callout>

</ui>
